  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>The Butcher’s Village</b> is a psychological slasher horror game that provides a horrifying experience. Explore unsettling environments, solve intricate puzzles, and struggle to survive in a village that is at once eerily familiar and terrifyingly real.<p></p>\n<p>Murtaza, living in North America in 2001, receives a desperate call from his friend, who says he’s been in an accident on a rainy evening. He drives through heavy rain, but because of the dense fog, he gets into an accident. When he regains consciousness, his vehicle is wrecked and won’t start. As he looks around, he notices an eerie village nearby, shrouded in the storm.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Narrative-Driven Horror</b>: A deeply story-focused experience, with an atmosphere that surrounds you in tension.\n</li><li><b>Genre</b>: Walking simulator emphasizing exploration.\n</li><li><b>Visual Style</b>: An aesthetic inspired by the early 2000s.\n</li><li><b>Surreal Fear</b>: What looks ordinary at first slowly changes into something you can’t explain.\n</li><li><b>Sound Design</b>: Immersive audio wraps around you, raising the tension and slowly drawing you into madness.\n</li><li><b>Puzzle Solving</b>: Solve intricate puzzles to progress and unveil mysteries.\n</li></ul>\n",
